Support Platform: Hygon, INTEL, AMD, etc.
Support OS: CentOS, Ubuntu, Debian, Rocky, RHEL, etc.
Support Item: Stress, DC, Reboot
Installation: System tools (nvme-cli, sdparm, smartctl, fio, nmon) are now installed online via package managers (apt/yum/dnf).

1.Fio Stress
    run as: sh Fio_All.sh -i [lawdiskstress|filesystemstress] -o [single|all|both]

2.Fio DC
    run as: sh Fio_All.sh -i dc -l 10
    Power-cycle FIO uses a generated random FILL/STRESS/VERIFY plan (scattered windows).

3.Fio Reboot
    run as: sh Fio_All.sh -i reboot -l 10
    Power-cycle FIO uses a generated random FILL/STRESS/VERIFY plan (scattered windows).

4.MachineCheck
    default YES
    set '-c no' to modify it
    eg:sh Fio_All.sh -i [lawdiskstress|filesystemstress] -c no

5.specify csv file
    default
        DC/Reboot: generated powercycle_auto.csv
        Stress:   Input_Config_Disk_Full_Scan.csv
     you can set param '-n ***.csv' to specify stress Configure file
     eg:sh Fio_All.sh -i [lawdiskstress|filesystemstress]  -n Input_Config_Disk_Full_Scan.csv

6.specify disk
  Default:all disk except system disk
  you can set param '-u sdb,sdc' or '-u sdb' to specify test disk
  eg: sh Fio_All.sh -i [lawdiskstress|filesystemstress] -u sdb

7.Log file:
    ./log/TestErrorLog/ 测试过程中的error信息记录
    ./log/RawLog/测试过程中的原始信息记录,如MachineCheck,SystemLog

8.Result file:
    ./log/ResultLog/*

9.Mix Stress
    Mix模式fio模型不需要自己配置,由程序自动生成
    裸盘Mix run as: sh Fio_All.sh -mix yes
    文件系统Mix run as: sh Fio_All.sh -mix yes -i filesystemstress

10. Cancel/Restore
    中途取消测试并清理环境 (清理自启动项):
    run as: sh Fio_All.sh -i restore
